~~~js
function readRetries(text) {
  if (text.trim() === "") return null;
  const count = Number(text);
  return Number.isInteger(count) && count >= 0 ? count : null;
}
readRetries(" 0 "); // 0
readRetries(" ");   // null
~~~
Trimming detects absence before Number can turn it into zero.

